2924 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Sincere thanks and profound appreciation are extended to all the institutions\054 churches\054 families\054 friends\054 teachers\054 mentors\054 supporters\054 and well\055wishers who have shared their love\054 care\054 guidance\054 encouragement\054 and support throughout the formative years and life journey of \nC\056 James White\056)
     /K [ 16 ]
     /P 2925 0 R
     /Pg 2892 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

