2926 0 obj
  << /ActualText (From childhood onward\054 countless compassionate hearts became instruments of God\031s providence through education\054 shelter\054 food\054 clothing\054 spiritual nurturing\054 friendship\054 encouragement\054 and opportunities for personal growth and service\056 The kindness\054 discipline\054 prayers\054 generosity\054 and goodwill received over the years have played a significant role in shaping character\054 strengthening faith\054 inspiring purpose\054 and fostering a lifelong commitment to truth\054 compassion\054 wisdom\054 and humanitarian service\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 2927 0 R
     /Pg 2892 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

