2928 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Special gratitude is offered to the many devoted servants of God\054 church leaders\054 statesmen\054 philosopher\055guides\054 distinguished mentors\054 educators\054 and spiritual counselors whose wisdom\054 example\054 and guidance helped illuminate the path of faith\054 learning\054 leadership\054 and service\056 Their teachings\054 counsel\054 and noble lives continue to inspire dedication to God\054 love for humanity\054 and the pursuit of righteousness and truth\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 2929 0 R
     /Pg 2892 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
