  << /ActualText (The loving support\054 noble examples\054 and enduring influence of many individuals and institutions remain deeply cherished and gratefully remembered\056 Every act of kindness\024whether great or small\024has left a lasting impression and continues to inspire unwavering faith in God\054 sincere love for humanity\054 and steadfast dedication to serving others\056)
     /K [ 19 ]
     /P 2931 0 R
     /Pg 2892 0 R
