  << /ActualText (May the Lord abundantly bless\054 strengthen\054 guide\054 and reward all those who\054 in countless ways\054 have shared their lives\054 resources\054 prayers\054 encouragement\054 wisdom\054 and goodwill with love and sincerity\056 Their invaluable contributions\054 friendship\054 and support will forever be remembered with gratitude\054 honor\054 respect\054 and heartfelt appreciation\056 Their legacy of kindness continues to illuminate the path of service\054 faith\054 and hope for generations to come\056)
     /K [ 20 ]
